  "notes": "Inputs 1-2 are combo XLR/6.35 mm jack: mic on XLR, line or instrument (INST) on jack. Kensington lock not listed. Line Inputs 3-4 and Line Outputs 1-4 are rear 6.35 mm TRS jacks; the MONITOR knob controls Outputs 1-2. MIDI In/Out are 5-pin DIN. Routing via Focusrite Control. Controls from the user guide, 'Front Panel': GAIN 1 and 2, 48V (both combo inputs), MONITOR (level of outputs 1 and 2 only) and headphone level. INST, AIR and PAD (where present) are set in the Focusrite Control software, not on the device (it only shows LEDs), so they are not shown here; which input reaches which output is also set there. Assumption: levels at MIN are silent.",
